        }
      }
    },
    "Sample song" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示例歌曲"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Design review in 10 minutes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设计评审 · 10 分钟后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sample" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make more of your notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让刘海，多一点用处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Music, notifications and handy tools, right where you look. And a piano cat to keep you company." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音乐、通知和常用工具，抬眼就能找到。还有一只陪着你的钢琴猫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Control at hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随手控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See what's playing and adjust the volume." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看播放内容，调整音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fewer interruptions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "少些打断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read notifications and your schedule in the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海查看通知与日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little company" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一点陪伴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listen to music and keep an eye on your Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听音乐，也看看 Mac 的状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on what suits you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你的习惯开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up only what you need; the rest can wait. Everything can be changed later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只设置需要的功能，其余可以留到以后。所有功能都能稍后在设置中调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Features" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功能列表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic (recommended)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动识别（推荐）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose where music comes from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择播放来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the music (optional)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跟随音乐律动（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draws the waveform and the cat's notes from the music that's playing; the mixer needs it too. Audio is analysed on this Mac and never recorded or saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据正在播放的音乐绘制波形和猫的音符，混音器也需要它。音频只在本机分析，不会录制或保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Audio Recording" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统音频录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses what macOS reports as playing; works with most players and browsers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过系统当前的播放信息获取内容，适用于多数播放器和浏览器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See how to set it up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看配置方法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications & system indicators." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知与系统提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show supported notification banners, and volume and brightness changes, in the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海中显示支持的通知横幅，以及音量和亮度变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace the volume and brightness indicators" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "替换系统的音量与亮度提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads notification banners, and the volume and brightness keys." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于读取通知横幅，以及音量和亮度按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More notification features" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更多通知功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the notification history and Focus (optional)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读取通知记录与专注状态（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the Notification Center database on this Mac to add notifications whose banners are off, and detects which Focus is on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在本机读取通知中心的数据库，补充没有显示横幅的通知，并识别当前的专注模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全磁盘访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar & reminders." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日程与提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read on this Mac only, to show in the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在本机读取，用于在刘海中显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show your schedule in the notch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海中显示日程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See upcoming events." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看即将开始的日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See reminders with a set time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看已设定时间的提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Need a mirror? Take a look." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要时，照一下镜子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview your camera in the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海中预览摄像头画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the mirror in the notch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海中显示镜子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is used only while the mirror is open; nothing is recorded or saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在打开镜子时使用摄像头，不录制或保存画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed · Open the mirror in the notch to try it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已允许 · 在刘海中打开镜子试试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Camera Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问摄像头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on NekoNotch in the list, then come back here. The status updates by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在列表中打开 NekoNotch 的开关后回到这里，状态会自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All set. Take a look at the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "准备好了，去刘海看看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the pointer to the notch at the top of the screen to open NekoNotch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将指针移到屏幕顶部的刘海区域，展开 NekoNotch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Music source" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音乐来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up later" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "稍后设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already granted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已授权"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch uses %@ to read notification banners and show them in the notch, and to replace the system's volume and brightness indicators." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NekoNotch 使用%@读取通知横幅并显示在刘海中，同时用于替换系统的音量和亮度提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Banners are read on this Mac only. Nothing is collected or shared." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "横幅仅在本机读取，不收集或共享任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Full Disk Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启完全磁盘访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch reads the Notification Center database, so notifications still reach the notch when an app's banners are off, and reads which Focus is on. macOS doesn't let apps ask for this: turn on NekoNotch under Full Disk Access in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NekoNotch 会读取通知中心的数据库，即使应用关闭了横幅，通知也能显示在刘海中；同时读取当前开启的专注模式。macOS 不允许应用主动请求此权限，请在“系统设置”的“完全磁盘访问”中开启 NekoNotch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database is read on this Mac only. Nothing is collected or shared." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据库仅在本机读取，不收集或共享任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run setup again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新运行引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walks through the welcome page and each permission again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新显示欢迎页，并逐项设置各项权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repository" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Based on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Accessibility Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开辅助功能设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Full Disk Access Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开完全磁盘访问设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Half load" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "半载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warp" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跃迁"
          }
        }
