    "Get a message in the notch when the battery drops to each selected level while unplugged. Each level speaks once per discharge and arms again after charging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get a message in the notch when the battery drops to each selected level while unplugged. Each level speaks once per discharge and arms again after charging."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未接电源时，电量降至所选阈值就会在刘海中提醒。每个阈值在一次放电过程中只提醒一次，充电后可再次触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on \"Show power status notifications\" above to use battery alerts." : {
      "localizations" : {
