    "Time-sensitive (notch only)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间敏感（仅刘海）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Camera Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问摄像头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NekoNotch 的镜子功能可在刘海中显示摄像头画面，便于整理仪容。摄像头权限仅用于实时预览，可随时在应用中开启或关闭此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your camera is never used without your consent, and nothing is recorded or stored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "摄像头仅在获得授权并开启镜子功能后使用，不会录制或保存画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Calendar Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问日历"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问日历后，NekoNotch 可在刘海中集中显示即将开始的日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your calendar data is only used to show your events and is never shared." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日历数据仅用于显示日程，不会对外共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Reminders Access" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问提醒事项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch can show your scheduled reminders alongside your calendar events. Access to Reminders is needed to display your reminders." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许访问提醒事项后，NekoNotch 可在日程旁显示已设定时间的提醒事项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your reminders data is only used to show your reminders and is never shared." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒事项数据仅用于显示提醒，不会对外共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Real-Time Audio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用实时音频可视化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NekoNotch can analyze the audio playing from your music app to draw a live FFT waveform in the notch, with only a minimal impact on CPU usage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NekoNotch 可分析音乐应用正在播放的音频，通过 FFT 绘制刘海中的实时波形，CPU 开销较低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio is processed locally for the visualizer and never recorded, stored, or shared." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频仅在本机处理，用于绘制实时波形，不会录制、保存或对外共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
