    "Replace the waveform while playing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "播放时用钢琴猫替代波形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the system monitor from the cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过钢琴猫打开系统监测"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make way for app menus" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "避让应用菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app has so many menus that the left side of the notch covers the last of them, it folds away as the pointer comes over it, and opens again once the pointer has left the menu bar and no menu is open. This works while music or a notification shows too, and the cat keeps running and singing meanwhile." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用的菜单项较多、刘海左侧盖住最后几个菜单时，指针移到左侧，左侧即收起；指针离开菜单栏且没有菜单展开后，左侧重新展开。播放音乐或显示通知时同样如此，收起期间猫照常奔跑和唱歌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While nothing plays, a pixel cat with a piano keyboard for a body runs on the right of the closed notch, with an empty wing of the same width on the left. It runs faster the busier the CPU is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未播放媒体时，键盘造型的像素猫在收起的刘海右侧奔跑，左侧显示等宽星空。CPU 占用率越高，奔跑速度越快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last 60 seconds" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近 60 秒"
          }
        }
