    "Full-screen scrolling (notch only)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全屏滚动通知（仅刘海）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In full screen the notch stays hidden, so a notification's text runs once through this line under it, and the icon shows where it came from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全屏时，刘海保持收起。通知文字在刘海下方单行滚动一次，并显示来源应用的图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send test notification" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送测试通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test notification" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you can read this, notifications reach the notch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看到此消息，表示刘海已成功显示通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications from NekoNotch are turned off in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统设置中已关闭 NekoNotch 的通知权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A real system notification goes through the whole chain and may show a system banner. The notch-only kinds skip the system, which is the only way to try the time-sensitive look and the line that runs under the hidden notch in full screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“真实系统通知”用于测试完整的接收流程，可能显示系统横幅。“仅刘海”测试直接预览刘海中的通知样式。测试时间敏感通知或全屏滚动通知时，请选择对应的“仅刘海”选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Background Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "后台项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icon-only apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅显示图标的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No icon-only apps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有仅显示图标的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icon only" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icon stays for" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图标停留时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications from these apps only show the app's icon on the left of the closed notch, and the notch does not open for them. While music is playing, the icon takes the album art's place and the art comes back when it goes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收到这些应用的通知时，仅在刘海左侧显示应用图标，刘海保持收起。播放音乐时，图标会暂时替换专辑封面，消失后恢复封面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview the line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预览电量线"
