          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Following the Focus, the notch only shows what the system lets through: notifications that still get a banner, and time-sensitive ones. The others go to the history. Reading the Focus needs Full Disk Access, and one that starts on a schedule is not detected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Following the Focus, the notch only shows what the system lets through: notifications that still get a banner, and time-sensitive ones. The others go to the history. Reading the Focus needs Full Disk Access, and one that starts on a schedule is not detected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择“跟随专注模式”时，刘海只显示系统允许提醒的通知，包括仍会弹出横幅的通知和时间敏感通知。其余通知仅记入历史。读取专注模式状态需要完全磁盘访问权限；按计划自动开启的专注模式无法识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a history" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep a history"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留通知历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a Notifications tab to the notch with the last %lld notifications. Kept in memory only and cleared when the app quits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds a Notifications tab to the notch with the last %lld notifications. Kept in memory only and cleared when the app quits."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在刘海中添加“通知”标签页，显示最近 %lld 条通知。历史只保存在内存中，退出应用后清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld in the history" : {
