    "Download NekoNotch %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载 NekoNotch %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While media plays, the cat takes the waveform's place beside the album art, and coloured notes float off behind it instead of the rainbow, at a steady pace, or more of them the louder the music when they follow the volume (this needs the realtime audio waveform). Hovering over the cat or clicking it opens CPU, memory, network, storage, battery and energy use instead of the usual tabs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "播放媒体时，钢琴猫可替代专辑封面旁的音频波形，并随音乐飘出彩色音符。音符默认匀速飘出；开启“音符跟随音量”后，音量越大，音符越多（需要开启实时音频波形）。启用系统监测入口后，悬停或点击钢琴猫即可查看 CPU、内存、网络、存储、电池和应用耗电情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notes follow the volume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音符跟随音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cat at its fastest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "猫的最高速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stars at their fastest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "星空的最高速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cat and the stars speed up with the CPU load, from their resting pace up to the speeds above: reached at the warp threshold with warp speed on, at full load with it off. With warp speed on, past the threshold the stars give way to streaks of light; they come back once the load drops 10% below it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU 占用率越高，猫和星空的移动速度越快：开启跃迁效果时，在跃迁阈值处达到设定倍数；关闭时，在满载时达到。开启跃迁效果后，占用率达到阈值时，星星变为光线；低于阈值 10 个百分点时，恢复星星效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piano Cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "钢琴猫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the piano cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示钢琴猫"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
